title: "Fifty-Eight Disjoint Obtuse Pairs at the Seven-Dimensional First Excess"
authors:
  - given-names: Yongxian
    family-names: Zhang
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Any 127 points of a seven-dimensional 60-degree spherical code, if such a configuration exists, have at least 58 pairwise disjoint pairs at angles strictly greater than 120 degrees. The result does not determine the kissing number."
